From: Noa Himesaka <himesaka@noa.codes>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: sm8350-b2q: TDM bit clock not inverted

Stock's primary TDM has qcom,msm-cpudai-tdm-clk-attribute = [00 01], a
bit clock that the AFE does not invert; the amps invert it themselves.
Set qcom,tdm-clk-attribute = <1> on PRIMARY_TDM_RX_0.

Signed-off-by: Noa Himesaka <himesaka@noa.codes>
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8350-samsung-b2q.dts |    8 ++++++++
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+)


diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8350-samsung-b2q.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8350-samsung-b2q.dts
index bb4b55b..7727cab 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8350-samsung-b2q.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8350-samsung-b2q.dts
@@ -2557,6 +2557,14 @@
 		qcom,tdm-invert-sync = <0>;
 		qcom,tdm-data-delay = <1>;
 		qcom,tdm-data-align = <0>;
+		/*
+		 * Stock qcom,msm-cpudai-tdm-clk-attribute = [00 01]: the bit
+		 * clock is not inverted at the AFE. The amps sample on the
+		 * inverted edge (IB_NF on the codec side, as stock); with the
+		 * AFE inverting too they sampled on the launch edge and the
+		 * speakers hissed.
+		 */
+		qcom,tdm-clk-attribute = <1>;
 	};
 }; 
 
